<h1>Sound Design</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Game audio, sound design, implementation and interactive audio.</p>

<!-- PLACEHOLDER -->
<div class="ph">
  <p>I design and implement sound for games: creature voices, footsteps and foley, UI, ambiences that react to the player, and the systems that tie it all together in engine. I'm comfortable taking a project from the first recording session through to a finished, mixed build, using FMOD or Wwise with Unity and Unreal Engine.</p>
  <p>New here? Start with the <a href="/sound-design/reel/">Game Sound Design Reel</a>.</p>
</div>

