<h2>What I do</h2>
<!-- PLACEHOLDER -->
<div class="ph">
  <ul>
    <li>Sound design: recording, editing, layering and processing original assets</li>
    <li>Implementation in FMOD Studio and Wwise, integrated with Unity and Unreal Engine</li>
    <li>Interactive and adaptive audio: parameter-driven ambiences, music systems and mix snapshots</li>
    <li>Field recording and foley</li>
    <li>Dialogue editing and creature vocals</li>
  </ul>
